<pb n="140" facs="#f0146"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#g">Die Bern&#x017F;teinhexe</hi>.</fw><lb/>
<sp who="#RUED"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Rüdiger</hi></speaker> <stage>(auf&#x017F;tehend).</stage><lb/>
<p>Nun, da i&#x017F;t es al&#x017F;o ausge&#x017F;prochen.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WIT"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Wittich.</hi></speaker><lb/>
