<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#g">Die Bern&#x017F;teinhexe</hi>.</fw><lb/>
<sp who="#BIR"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Birkhahn</hi></speaker> <stage>(voreilend).</stage><lb/>
<p>Junker, Junker! &#x2014; der Vogel i&#x017F;t gefangen. Jch kann&#x2019;s<lb/>
