ren haben, wenn&#x2019;s nichts mehr &#x017F;chadet, das macht nicht<lb/>
Viel aus. &#x2014;</p> <stage>(Wittich tritt ein, er i&#x017F;t blaß.)</stage></sp></div><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>
<pb n="214" facs="#f0220"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#g">Die Bern&#x017F;teinhexe</hi>.</fw><lb/>
<div n="3"><head><hi rendition="#g">Zweite Scene</hi>.</head><lb/>
<stage><hi rendition="#g">Wittich</hi> (mit einem Armleuchter). &#x2014; <hi rendition="#g">Wulf</hi>.</stage><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <sp who="#WUL"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Wulf</hi></speaker> <stage>(auf&#x017F;tehend).</stage><lb/>
<p>Wer da?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WIT"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Wittich.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<p>Du wach&#x017F;t?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WUL"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Wulf.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<p>Freilich!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WIT"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Wittich.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<p>Kann&#x017F;t auch nicht &#x017F;chlafen, Schalksknecht!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WUL"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Wulf.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<p>O ja!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WIT"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Wittich.</hi></speaker><lb/>
