<sp who="#RUED"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Rüdiger</hi></speaker> <stage>(zu Marie).</stage><lb/>
<p>Eine Kriegsli&#x017F;t des Bur&#x017F;chen.</p></sp><lb/>
<pb n="249" facs="#f0255"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#g">Die Bern&#x017F;teinhexe</hi>.</fw><lb/>
<sp who="#MAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Marie.</hi></speaker><lb/>
